This project wraps and invokes the HeyGen REST API (https://developers.heygen.com)
to generate avatar videos. HeyGen is a third-party service requiring its own API
key and is governed by HeyGen's Terms of Service. This skill does not redistribute
HeyGen content, models, or proprietary code. Generated video output is governed by
HeyGen's terms; consult them for commercial use, attribution, and licensing of
output content.

API charges incurred through use of this skill are the responsibility of the user.
